=4 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Abelard} (G-9) to receive {i:Selbina Clay|Selbina Clay|571}.
* Trade the {i:Selbina Clay|Selbina Clay|571} to a Stone Monument to receive a {i:Clay Tablet|Clay Tablet|570}.
** If you interact with the monument, you will receive extensive and interesting {p:Lore} background of the area.
*** The inscriptions are available on the {p:Stone Monument} page.
* Return to {n:Abelard} and trade the {i:Clay Tablet|Clay Tablet|570} to him.
* Repeat for the remaining Stone Monuments. The quest will not "Complete" until you finish all tablets.

